      "writtenOn": "2018-02-28T17:59:16Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I don\u0027t think this is applicable to IWLAN; for IWLAN, the equivalent LCE information is provided by the WiFi HAL, but LCE is a very strange beast. It ideally wouldn\u0027t go through data connection and instead it would go through network factory on a per-transport basis. There just isn\u0027t a concept of a per-transport thing. That said, it also doesn\u0027t *not* belong in DataService either... I\u0027ll have to think about it.",
